---
// ABOUTME: The open-source pitch: MIT badge, "Own your licensing" headline, and the
// ABOUTME: copyable docker compose chip beside the GitHub button.
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-6 py-22 text-center lg:px-10">
	<span
		class="mb-5.5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-[20px] border border-chip-line bg-chip px-3.5 py-1.5 font-semibold text-[13px] text-moss"
		>Open source · MIT core</span
	>
	<h2
		class="mx-auto my-0 max-w-[760px] text-balance font-semibold text-[clamp(30px,3.8vw,44px)] text-ink leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.022em]"
	>
		Own your licensing. Literally.
	</h2>
	<p class="mx-auto mt-4.5 mb-0 max-w-[600px] text-[18px] text-smoke leading-[1.55]">
		Your license layer should not be a black box you rent. CoolBeans is open source, so you can
		read the code, run it on your own box, and keep every key and customer record on
		infrastructure you control.
	</p>
	<div class="mt-7.5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
		<button
			type="button"
			data-copy="docker compose up"
			data-copy-toast="Copied. Cool beans."
			title="Copy"
			class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 rounded-[10px] bg-coal py-[11px] pr-3 pl-4 font-mono text-[#e8e7e0] text-[14px]"
			><span class="text-[#6b7a52]">$</span><span
				>docker <span class="text-lime">compose up</span></span
			><span
				class="inline-flex size-7 items-center justify-center rounded-[7px] bg-white/8 text-[#b8b8af]"
				><svg
					width="14"
					height="14"
					viewBox="0 0 24 24"
					fill="none"
					stroke="currentColor"
					stroke-width="2"
					aria-hidden="true"
					><rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"></rect><path
						d="M5 15V5a2 2 0 012-2h10"></path></svg
				></span
			></button
		>
		<a
			href="https://github.com/GoldenBerry-SO/coolbeans"
			class="inline-flex items-center gap-[7px] rounded-[10px] bg-ink px-4.5 py-3 font-semibold text-[15px] text-white hover:bg-black"
			>View on GitHub<svg
				width="15"
				height="15"
				viewBox="0 0 24 24"
				fill="none"
				stroke="currentColor"
				stroke-width="2.4"
				stroke-linecap="round"
				aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg
			></a
		>
	</div>
</section>
